--- new3( hash={} )
--- new_from_hash( hash={} )

Parameter hash has following case-insensitive keys:
 * host
 * path
 * port
 * proxy_host
 * proxy_port
 * user
 * password
 * use_ssl
 * timeout

Calls [[m:XMLRPC::Client.new]] with the corresponding values.

